latentPresence ships no AI models and performs no inference of its own. Speech
recognition, speech synthesis, language, embedding and affect models are either
downloaded by the user at runtime, after an explicit consent screen showing size,
licence and source, or reached through endpoints the user configures (Ollama,
LM Studio, vLLM, llama.cpp, or a cloud provider with the user's own key). Models
and weights obtained through this application carry their own licences, which the
user is responsible for reviewing and complying with.

Character, set and animation assets are distributed under their own licences,
recorded alongside them in assets/.
